* Bio Protocol
** Assets launched
*** BioDAOs (VitaDAO, HairDAO, CryoDAO...)
*** IP-Tokens (IPT)
*** BioAgents (AI scientists)
** Tokens
*** BIO (ERC20, 3.32 B initial, uncapped)
*** vBIO (vesting, non-transferable)
*** veBIO (vote-escrow, 1 week to 2 years)
*** BioXP (points, expire after 14 days)
** V2 Launchpad
*** Ignition Sale (fixed price, USDC)
*** Pro-rata allocation by BioXP, 1 % cap
*** Liquidity Engine (AMM seeding)
*** Limit-sell fundraising at FDV milestones
*** 1 % swap tax (70 % project / 30 % Bio)
** Open-source contracts
*** Token.sol (roles, gated transfers)
*** TokenVesting (virtual token)
*** TokenVestingMerkle(Purchasable)
*** MerkleAirdrop.sol
** Security
*** Pashov (2023, 2024, 2025 x2)
*** FYEO (2025 x2)
*** Private launchpad code
